      "start": 987.59,
      "end": 989.03
    },
    {
      "en": "Today I'll talk about how to improve your pronunciation.",
      "asr_range": [
        1613,
        1622
      ],
      "start": 989.61,
      "end": 994.49
    },
    {
      "en": "Language researchers say pronunciation and fluency are the biggest barriers, followed by grammar, in effective spoken English.",
      "asr_range": [
        1622,
        1639
      ],
      "start": 994.73,
      "end": 1006.01
    },
    {
      "en": "However, most people don't regard pronunciation as a very important part of communication skills.",
